    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "The Skatepark",
      "sub": "The Pool · Day",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "[mood:day_bright]EXT. THE SKATEPARK — DAY",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/005.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "Faust is with his friends Wagner and Jacob, waiting to push off into the pool. Faust talks to each in turn.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/006.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "left"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "center"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "jacob",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "right"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "[shot:closeup person]Fun just to imagine how the world could be.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/010.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Different future points — the smallest thing.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/011.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Jacob",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Could change the big picture completely.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/012.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Pebbles on the water's surface.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/013.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "I feel old just coming out here.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/014.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "[shot:closeup person_b]Not so bad. Giving me hope for the future.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/015.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Jacob",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Plz watch me epic fail plz.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/016.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "You're getting better, bro.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/017.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "I need to finally try this.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/018.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Start off easy, Faust.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/019.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "[shot:closeup person]Break tailbone later.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/020.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Earn mad skills through trial and error.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/021.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "bg",
      "src": "3d:wagner_home"
    },
    {
      "t": "hide",
      "pos": "left"
    },
    {
      "t": "hide",
      "pos": "center"
    },
    {
      "t": "hide",
      "pos": "right"
    },
    {
      "t": "interlude",
      "text": "Wagner's Home",
      "sub": "After the park",
      "duration": 1800
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "INT. WAGNER'S HOME — DAY. Wagner puts up his skateboard, goes to the record player, and starts some metal.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/027.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "left"
    },
    {
      "t": "show",
      "char": "faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "pos": "right"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "[shot:closeup person]This here is the shit.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/030.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "What is this I'm hearing?",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/031.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Burzum. Norwegian Black Metal.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/032.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Euronymous and Varg Vikernes.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/033.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Metal-sad — those folk so wrapped up in the story, can't see past what they are creating.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/034.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Faust",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "[shot:closeup person_b]We need to get a good crew. Take the longboat out tonight. Prowl uncertain waters.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/035.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "say",
      "char": "Wagner",
      "expr": "neutral",
      "text": "Then let us away — to Judgement Day.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/036.mp3"
    },
    {
      "t": "narrate",
      "text": "They make haste to their ride of choice — JD, a beat-up piece of shit.",
      "voice": "assets/audio/voice/vol1_ch2_skatepark/037.mp3"
    },
